  concept: "Authored objective: 5 V Supply.\nAuthored requirement: Verify the 5 V
    power source. voltage \u2265 4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2 V. Connection pair Battery_positive
    and Battery_negative.\nGeneral teaching principle: Electrical measurements are
    differences or flows that require a correct reference, operating condition and
    fresh solver evidence.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish
    that this objective is complete."
  analogy: A pressure gauge needs a reference; a voltage measurement likewise depends
    on its defined points.
